    ✔ blocks stage actions while loading and reapplies the loading lock after mount resolves (165ms)
    ✔ shows an accessible return-main-hall control away from preset and hides it during a panel lock (71ms)
    ✔ uses screen-to-world center math for return visibility at non-unit zoom (50ms)
    ✔ throttles return refresh, polls reset completion, and cancels callbacks on unmount (67ms)
    ✔ renders the hall scene body as a melonJS canvas shell without DOM room or agent layers
